                "text": "The bill that\u00a0President Trump & Republicans are trying to pass\u00a0would\u00a0cut health care coverage for almost 11 million Americans\u00a0\u2014 including\u00a0hundreds of thousands of Michiganders.\n\nTaking health care away from seniors & children to give tax cuts to the ultra-wealthy makes no sense.\u00a0I\u2019ll never support that.",
