                "text": "Here\u2019s the deal right now: Trump and Republicans are willing to shut down the government instead of work with Democrats to prevent health care costs from rising even more. People are already hurting as a result of Trump\u2019s severe cuts, and Americans\u2019 premiums are expected to double.\n\nWe must take action to ensure people can still access affordable health care.",
